  {
    "id": "flashback",
    "name": "Flashback",
    "description": "A desaturated sepia memory with a soft white vignette and film flicker: the character smiles in a remembered place, a 'Memory' caption slides in and memory lines fade in. Optionally a white flash returns to the colourful present on a word.",
